@prefix : <https://example.test/model#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
<https://example.test/model> a owl:Ontology .
:cPerson a owl:Class .
:cOrg a owl:Class .
:cAddress a owl:Class .
:aAge a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :cPerson ; rdfs:range xsd:int .
:aNote a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :cPerson .
:aAddress a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :cPerson ; rdfs:range :cAddress .
:eTarget a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :cPerson ; rdfs:range :cOrg .
:eSource a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :cOrg ; rdfs:range :cPerson ; owl:inverseOf :eTarget .
